{
 "_help": "Overworld level zones (scripts/Zones.cs). Each zone is a circle in WORLD metres (x/z centre, r radius); where circles overlap the smallest one wins, so rings and wide land zones can hold smaller hot spots. Outside every zone the old distance formula (tuning.json world.metresPerAreaLevel) is used. A zone's level rises from minLvl on its side nearest Oakhaven to maxLvl on its far side and is FIXED (monsters no longer copy the hero's level). In the Shadow realm, home-island zones add shadowAdd levels. Rewards: xpMul / goldMul multiply experience and gold (on top of the level), lootBonus adds rarity weight (LootTables.RollRarity) and itemChance adds to the item drop chance; items drop at the monster's level. packs = light-realm pack templates picked at random (repeat a name to weight it), shadowPacks = Shadow-realm packs (home island only; land monsters are seen in both realms), density / shadowDensity = how many packs the zone holds. boss (optional) = a world boss placed in the zone at maxLvl + bossLvl.",

 "rules": {
  "_help": "aggroMul: overworld (non-boss) monsters notice heroes at their enemies.json aggro x this. leash: they give up the chase when farther than this from their camp, or when the hero is farther than max(aggro x leashHeroMul, leashHeroMin); while running home they evade (ignore damage) for evadeTime s and heal returnRegen x max health per second. packAlert: when one pack member notices a hero or is hit, its packmates within this many metres join. leaderLevels: a pack leader is this many levels above its pack [min, max]; leaderHp / leaderDmg multiply its health and damage, leaderReward its xp and gold, leaderItemChance adds to its item chance (and +1 loot bonus). respawn: a dead pack member comes back after [min, max] s (x the play-time threat respawn factor) once no hero is within respawnClear m of its camp. packSpacing: minimum metres between camps. maxActive: at most this many idle overworld monsters are run near the heroes at once (the nearest; fighting ones always run). maxEnemies: build-time cap on pack monsters.",
  "aggroMul": 0.6,
  "leash": 32, "leashHeroMul": 2.0, "leashHeroMin": 26, "evadeTime": 4, "returnRegen": 0.25,
  "packAlert": 12,
  "leaderLevels": [1, 2], "leaderHp": 1.6, "leaderDmg": 1.2, "leaderReward": 2.0, "leaderItemChance": 0.25,
  "respawn": [90, 180], "respawnClear": 60,
  "packSpacing": 30, "maxActive": 120, "maxEnemies": 900,
  "shadowAdd": 3
 },

